sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WM as Working memory<br/>(live session)
    participant A as Atlas<br/>(main LLM)
    participant MD as Core .md<br/>USER.md / WORKSPACE.md
    participant BUF as Daily log<br/>MEMORY-TODAY.md
    participant C as Nightly consolidator<br/>(cheap LLM)
    participant DB as Notes store

    Note over WM,MD: immediate lane - the agent teaches ITSELF
    WM->>A: lesson learned mid-turn
    A->>MD: memory.modify - write-through in the same turn
    A->>BUF: memory.append - raw capture

    Note over BUF,MD: org-shared lane - nightly lift
    C->>DB: drain buffers, merge cross-session patterns<br/>(invoice issues in 3 separate chats)
    C->>DB: fold canonical notes into topics
    C->>MD: compile pipeline zone (Consolidated insights),<br/>origin=PIPELINE, budget-capped, as-of stamped
    Note over MD: visible to EVERY agent in the workspace -<br/>one agent's lesson teaches all
